          │ House rules  what every agent always does · about 30s                        │
          │                                                                              │
          │ What should every agent always do?                                           │
          │ Tick the house rules you want and add your own. Agents follow them on every  │
          │ task. Change them any time in Settings → STANDARDS. Enter with nothing       │
          │ ticked skips.                                                                │
          │                                                                              │
          │ ✓ Write or update tests with every change                                    │
          │ ○ Keep commits small and focused                                             │
          │ ○ Ask before adding a dependency                                             │
          │ ○ Explain the why in commit messages                                         │
          │ ○ Never commit secrets or credentials                                        │
